    "raw": "The most harrowing time for the X'ian people came soon after. According to texts there are accounts that speak of invaders or visitors from 'elsewhere' that interrupted their progress through literal planetary upheaval and forced terraforming. While none of the records name this race speculation is high that it could have been the Anodyne due in part to their description being a close match. This is now, sadly, rumor pulled from antiquated records...at best.",
    "value": "对艾肯人而言，最痛苦的时刻很快便到来了。文献记载中提及，有来自“他处”的入侵者或访客，因行星剧变与被迫实施的星球改造，打断了他们的发展进程。尽管没有任何记录明确指出这一族群的名字，但外界普遍推测其很可能是燃星人，部分原因在于相关描述与他们的特征高度吻合。遗憾的是，这些信息如今仅是从陈旧记载中流传出的传闻....充其量也只是传闻。"
